ression was estimated to derive adjusted odds ratios (AORs)\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"p-values <0.05 were considered statistically significant.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}